# This directory stores Firebase service account JSON files
# These files are git-ignored for security

# Usage:
# - Save your Firebase service account JSON here
# - Name it: firebase-dev.json, firebase-prod.json, etc.
# - Reference in Pulumi config:
#   pulumi config set mock-mock:serviceAccountJsonPath ./secrets/firebase-dev.json

# IMPORTANT: Never commit .json files from this directory!
